---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · Lineagree" description="How Lineagree handles the data collected through the waiting list." lang="en" alt="/it/privacy">
  <article class="legal wrap plate">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="draft">Draft, to be reviewed by a legal adviser before launch. Translated from the Italian version.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>Only the email address you enter in the waiting list form, with the date you signed up.</p>
    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To let you know when the Lineagree app is available. We don't use your email for anything else and we don't pass it on to third parties.</p>
    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>Your consent, which you give by joining the list (GDPR Article 6(1)(a)). You can withdraw it at any time by leaving the list or writing to us. Withdrawing does not make what we did before unlawful.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep your email until we tell you the app is available, and in any case no longer than 24 months after you sign up. If you leave the list earlier, we delete it.</p>
    <h2>Where the data is kept</h2>
    <p>In a database run by an external provider (Supabase), on servers in the European Union (Ireland). Supabase processes the data on our behalf, as a data processor.</p>
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p>Francesco Saliniti. To see, correct or delete your data, write to <a href="mailto:trabajo17@outlook.it">trabajo17@outlook.it</a>.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask at any time to see, correct or delete your email, to restrict its use, or to receive it in a readable format. Every email we send you contains a link to leave the list.</p>
    <p>If you think we handle your data wrongly, you can complain to the Italian data protection authority, the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali (<a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it">garanteprivacy.it</a>), or to the supervisory authority of the EU country where you live.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { max-width: 760px; padding: calc(var(--u) * 6) calc(var(--u) * 5); margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 4); }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.2vw, 4.5rem); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: calc(var(--u) * 4) 0 var(--u); }
  .legal p { margin: 0; max-width: 68ch; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .draft { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 2) !important; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink) !important; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .legal { padding: calc(var(--u) * 4) calc(var(--u) * 2.5); } }
</style>
